  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe hine ofer þæt feormige sy ðæs ilcan wyrðe þæs ðe se ðeof, butan he hine ladian mæge, ðæt he him nan facn ne nane ðyfþe on nyste.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who harbours him longer shall be liable to the same treatment as the thief unless he can clear himself, [by proving] that he was unaware of any crime or theft committed by him.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
